      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_sister_27",
      "hash64": "D771BE0265E07263",
      "text": "Ja, es ist Jo. Puh, zum Glück hat er uns\\nnicht gesehen...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_select_05",
      "hash64": "CD41AB53A74E3F1F",
      "text": "Das ist Jo?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_select_06",
      "hash64": "CD41AC53A74E40D2",
      "text": "Er sieht ganz anders aus!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_sister_28",
      "hash64": "D771CB0265E0887A",
      "text": "Pssst, nicht so laut![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_brother_02",
      "hash64": "4F398E1CD20D01B2",
      "text": "Hab ich dir nicht gesagt, dass du fünf Pokémon\\ntrainieren sollst?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_mob_01",
      "hash64": "59A0E18F0F060CEF",
      "text": "T-Tut mir leid... Ich hatte diesen Monat zu Hause\\necht viel um die Ohren...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_brother_03",
      "hash64": "4F398F1CD20D0365",
