        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_brother_07",
      "hash64": "4F398B1CD20CFC99",
      "text": "Wer’s nicht ernst meint, hat in meiner AG\\nnichts zu suchen.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_mob_03",
      "hash64": "59A0E38F0F061055",
      "text": "W-Warte, Jo! Bitte gib mir noch ’ne Chance!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_sister_29",
      "hash64": "D771CC0265E08A2D",
      "text": "Das hat dich bestimmt überrascht, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_sister_30",
      "hash64": "D775490265E3946B",
      "text": "Seit der Exkursion ist Jo kaum wiederzuerkennen.\\nEr hat sich total verändert, sowohl äußerlich als\\r\\nauch in seinem Verhalten.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "5C2CDE8CB4CF4306",
      "text": "Oh Mann, das war grad echt nicht schön\\nmitanzusehen.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_sister_31",
      "hash64": "D775480265E392B8",
      "text": "Gah![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "5C2CDD8CB4CF4153",
      "text": "Sieh an, Hana und... dich kenn ich nicht.\\nHm, aber...[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "5C2CDC8CB4CF3FA0",
      "text": "Ich glaub, ich hab schon von dir gehört.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_sister_18",
      "hash64": "D76E450265DD6EF1",
      "text": "Na toll. Jetzt haben wir auch noch dich\\nan der Backe...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "5C2CE38CB4CF4B85",
      "text": "Ach komm, du könntest mich doch zumindest mal\\nvorstellen![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_sister_19",
      "hash64": "D76E440265DD6D3E",
      "text": "Das ist Levy... und der Typ ist echt das Letzte.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_sister_20",
      "hash64": "D771C30265E07AE2",
      "text": "Er war mal der stärkste Trainer an der\\nBlaubeer-Akademie. Betonung liegt auf „war“.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "sdc02_0088_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "5C2CE28CB4CF49D2",
      "text": "Na, vielen Dank auch.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
